* Tue Nov 17 2026 Steven Pritchard <steve@sicura.us> - 0.4.0
- Publish as `simp-nm`, a fork of `lsst-nm` 0.3.0. The `nm` class and the
  `nm::connection` defined type keep their names and parameters.
- Restart NetworkManager when `NetworkManager.conf` changes
- Allow puppet/extlib 8.x
- Require puppetlabs/stdlib 9 or later, for `stdlib::ensure_packages`
- Allow puppetlabs/stdlib 10.x
- Support EL 8, 9 and 10 (RedHat, CentOS Stream, AlmaLinux, Rocky, OracleLinux)
- Require OpenVox 8 or 9 (replaces the `puppet` requirement)
- Drop support for CentOS 7

* Sat Dec 02 2023 Joshua Hoblitt <josh@hoblitt.com> - 0.3.0
- Add the `nm::purge_connections` parameter
- Leave `readme-ifcfg-rh.txt` in `/etc/sysconfig/network-scripts` untouched

* Tue Aug 22 2023 Joshua Hoblitt <josh@hoblitt.com> - 0.2.0
- Allow puppet/extlib 7.x

* Fri Jul 07 2023 Joshua Hoblitt <josh@hoblitt.com> - 0.1.0
- Initial release
